{
    "title": "Live Weather Radar Launcher",
    "description": "Live Weather Radar Launcher is an easy-to-use weather app that allows you to track changing weather conditions with live radar maps and helps you prepare for unexpected weather. Simply swipe right from your home screen to access a live weather radar, forecast maps, weekly weather reports, air quality index, and more.\r\n\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n\u2713 Live weather radar\r\n\u2713 Forecast map\r\n\u2713 Radar map layers\r\n\u2713 Map modes\r\n\u2713 Hourly & weekly forecast\r\n\u2713 Temperature forecast & AQI\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note: As a launcher app, the layout of your home screen may change after install. Don\u2019t worry, all your apps are still on your phone - they just may be in a different location. To learn more, please visit our FAQ section: https://liveweatherradar.com/#faq \r\n\r\nWith a launcher app, you get the added benefits of: \r\n\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access \r\nView live weather radar maps and accurate weather forecasts by simply swiping right from your home screen!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1Home screen widget\r\nSee the time, weather, and more, conveniently on your home screen with our customized widget.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Wallpaper\r\nPersonalize your home or lock screen with a wide selection of beautiful weather themed wallpapers. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut\r\nUse the Weather Launcher shortcut on your home screen to get fast access to weather updates. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search \r\nApps and web search has never been easier. Search for installed apps or the web (powered by Yahoo) from multiple access points.\r\n\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s why you\u2019ll love this free weather app:\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f Live Weather Radar: \r\nStay on top of the weather in real time. Check areas of precipitation, so you're never caught off guard by sudden showers or unexpected weather.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Radar Forecast Map: \r\nView past weather patterns and expected conditions for up to 6 hours. Use the forecast playback feature to see both historical and future forecasts via an advanced radar layer.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce1 Radar Map Layers: \r\nGet detailed weather insights with our radar map layers. Track rain or snow, temperature patterns, cloud cover, wind forecasts, and sea level pressure for a comprehensive view of atmospheric conditions.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Map Modes: \r\nCustomize your weather experience with our map modes. Easily switch between light, dark, and satellite views to suit your viewing preferences.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc6 Hourly & 7-day Forecast: \r\nLive Weather Radar Launcher provides an hourly weather outlook for up to 96 hours, so you're always informed. Plan your week with our accurate 7-day forecasts.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf21\ufe0f Temperature Forecast & AQI: \r\nDress right for the weather with up-to-the-minute temperature information. Monitor the air quality in your area and make informed decisions about outdoor activities.\r\n\r\n\r\nDownload the Live Weather Radar Launcher and never be caught off-guard. \r\n\r\n\r\nPlease write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.\r\n\r\n\r\nYou give your consent to install Live Weather Radar Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app's Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\n\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\n\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://liveweatherradar.com/terms-of-service \r\nPrivacy Policy: https://liveweatherradar.com/privacy-policy",
